Subject: host: sign in and sign in again from the web client

Why: the standalone Host only signs in through the cindy-host login CLI with the
Host stopped. The paired browser now uses the original login page: social and
same-region SSO sign-in, runtime assembled in-process, pairing kept on sign-out.
The web shim also reports the Host's real owner generation instead of a fixed 1,
which left the model catalog pending after an in-process sign-in (found on
fnOS). Same code as the upstream PR, merged after 0004 (the logout redirect
that 0004 prefixes is removed here).
Upstream: issue https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/issues/10600, PR https://github.com/makecindy/cindy/pull/11048
Remove when: the PR is merged and upstream.lock moves past it.

